rst times  we've seen the construction of an io  base in-game usually an update drops we  all download it and suddenly a brand  spanking new perfectly erected building  is in place not this time we're going to  watch it build it's like hut watch io  edition what we can gather from this is  that this building will be important to  the story it's far too late in the  season for something irrelevant to be  added so i'm thinking this is a  defensive station to fire rockets at the  cube queen or take out the caretakers or  maybe we'll just use it as a place to  hug before the island is nuked from  history  okay we gotta get serious now because  something happened today that i've been  waiting for since day one of the new  chapter graham the gnome has gone  [Music]  for the last few years he sat proudly on  top of the radio station mast he's  watched everything with us and never  flinched but now he's gone this ties  into a much bigger story of the gnome  exodus they're aware something bad is  coming to the island and have been  trying to tell us to escape four weeks  now last update the final genomes caught  the bus in pleasant park and now every  single one of those little keemstar  warner bees have fled to the edge of the  island up to the north at craggy cliffs  a dozen gnomes including graham are  boarding the final boats to leave the  island to the west near the viking ship  another crew are ready to leave  including the dude that just lays down  all the time and then we have the crew  from the prison break a plan was hatched  to break the captured gnomes out of the  sheriff's office and flee south to the  lake above misty this worked flawlessly  until the group reached the dam three  weeks ago after falling down and  becoming stuck the crew was somehow able  to get moving again and this week can be  found in the swampland get your butt  over to this shack and you'll see the  biggest gang of gnomes ever recorded in  the wild  saying their final goodbyes and sailing 