 this is the end for it  which is a shame and again down at the  bunker where we can find sloan there's  still no difference down there  everything has remained how it was last  time an important update i haven't  covered this season that i was certain  would be relevant is down in the  woodlands a yellow shipping container  appeared in week one and beneath it was  a secret base someone had been living in  trying to stay unnoticed i'll be honest  i thought something would have happened  by now but nope it's just a secret poi  for the season so to those who dm me  telling me to cover this consider it  covered it's a cool place let's all hide  down here during the event and regret  everything over to the patch notes and i  know i don't usually cover these as they  are usually hella boring but just read  the first line update 18.40 is here and  the island is destabilizing this is to  announce the arrival of the salvaged  brute and it's a genius call back to the  first time we saw them appear during the  season x reveal  season x is here and the world is  destabilizing fast but don't worry and  now it's my duty to implore you to spend  every last piece of gold you have to  bring the brute to the game don't do it  for me don't do it for penny do it to  upset twitch streamers the brute strikes  fear into their hearts and they reveal  their true selves i'm not playing  anymore bro i'm off this game  i rest my case  the shopping cart is returning this week  too i haven't found it in game yet but  if it brings back the nostalgia of  chapter one count me in so if the  leakers are right this is the very last  update of the season so with that in  mind i took a look around to see if we  could see what happened over the years  did you know that the blast stain from  the spaceship thruster back in season  three is still here on the mountain side  that mini mission had us sending that  pod back into space  and over at sweaty sands there is still  the remains of last season's believer  beach in the waters around the beach are  tons of old items that once filled this  place now they're left to rot in the  waters below hey yo including this guy  so if this is the end of chapter 2 i'll  be sure to make a video going over the  entire story sometime but that leads to  a question which chapter would you say  is the best chapter 1 or chapter two  i'll keep my eye out for arguments in  the comments below i'm adam you're  awesome and so are these guys who have  kindly used my code and marrow this week  really appreciate it thank you very much  okay i think we're done and dusted here  i'll see you next time  oh there is one other thing this guy and  his crew arrived yay

